{"server":"tw","storyId":"act37side_level_act37side_06_beg","groupId":"act37side","stageId":"act37side_06","title":"“晚飯宣言”","storyCode":"GO-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act37side/level_act37side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e60c629725d95ff13b90b1a61f0f95a23a352a68644a7a7eec86cc3af11567f1","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>塔樓騎士瞭望塔後院</><p=2>1098年12月22日 5:32 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會在塔樓裡幫忙指揮大家恢復裡面的擺設呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，我也以為你在準備議長的廣播呢。再說了，我不會去干涉設計師們的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們比我更懂得怎麼打造一間博物館，我也很好奇未來的“塔樓騎士博物館”會帶給我什麼驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但紀念碑的雕刻，必須由我親手完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來看看，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到你還有這手藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候馬歇爾老師教我的，不過他總是喝醉忘東忘西，他真正的本事根本沒教給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，我介紹一下。這位是芬恩導師，最後一任警戒長，也是我最親近的長輩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是老弗格森，他教會了我怎麼喝酒。這位是蓓麗老師，她費盡心思才教會我怎麼化妝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是馬歇爾老師——這座雕像不是我刻的，是他喝醉後自己為自己刻的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是卡爾，愛哭鬼。這位是馬丁，每週都會偷偷溜出去，然後又被家人帶回來。這是凱倫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有……還有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"維娜輕輕地抱住了達格達，安慰著她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，維娜，我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是每次回到這裡，以前那些快要模糊的記憶又變得清晰起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還刻上了自己的名字，“伊莎貝爾·孟塔古”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔樓騎士從不缺席。我們都在這裡了，芬恩導師一定會很高興的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……其實議會還是可以保留塔樓騎士的制度，就算你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔樓騎士的使命已經完成了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞不再需要國王，自然也不需要塔樓騎士。讓歷史留在博物館裡，對我們來說已經是最好的結局了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然塔樓的燈火已經不必再為王宮點燃，我的使命，也到此為止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從今以後，倫蒂尼姆不會再有塔樓騎士伊莎貝爾，只有達格達……格拉斯哥幫的達格達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過維娜，如果你希望塔樓騎士留下來，我依然不會有任何猶豫。只要你想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別開這種玩笑了，達格達……你也聽說那些流言了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩和我們都在查是誰在散布那些謠言。但很顯然，很多人不僅相信了，甚至還真心支持——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“維娜·維多利亞即將加冕為王。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>聖馬爾索學校</><p=2>1098年12月22日 5:37 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奧先生！埃利西奧先生！請等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？小傑娜，還有其他問題想問我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是老師想邀請您留下來看看我們新戲劇的彩排——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，埃利西奧先生，您能幫我作證嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傑米跟我打賭，就算我能和奶奶一起搬去哥倫比亞，也不會比現在過得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他爸爸說，在哥倫比亞，像我們這樣的孩子根本沒機會上學，也不會有老師肯教我們排戲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傑米說您在課堂上說的那些根本是騙人的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傑娜，該你上場彩排了，不要再纏著埃利西奧先生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，老、老師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想邀請埃利西奧先生留下來看我們的彩排……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我吧。傑米還在台上等你，他快急哭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不在，他可是一句台詞都說不出來。快去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，傑米真討厭……好吧，我這就去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"生悶氣的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奧先生，您一定要留下來看我們的演出哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，埃利西奧先生，請原諒孩子們的童言無忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我對哥倫比亞的情況不太瞭解，也不清楚那邊會怎麼對待感染的孩子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會得到很好的照顧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只要他們的監護人能負擔得起醫療保險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實孩子們都很喜歡您。我也很感謝您願意教導他們如何照顧自己，這對他們來說非常重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在老家也常常為孩子們講解這些，沒什麼麻煩的。反而是要謝謝您，願意讓我來這裡上課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本還擔心因為議會和我們赤心醫療的關係，學校會不希望我接觸孩子們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是議會從來沒有禁止我們與您接觸啊？相反，在某種程度上，他們一直是默許的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是您，我們還曾經邀請羅德島的醫生來幫孩子們做體檢和講課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"議會很清楚，這些孩子需要幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可光是講課和體檢並不能真正幫助到他們，他們需要的是藥物治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。但我們現在能做的就是陪伴他們，讓他們不至於被恐懼吞噬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，在這所學校裡，他們還能像過去一樣生活……像正常的孩子一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我很敬佩您，茉莉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的家鄉，一名感染的孩子能夠像這裡的孩子們一樣活力滿滿，往往意味著他的家庭能為他投入大筆資金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是在這裡……我聽說有些孩子無處可去，是您把他們留在學校裡。他們在您的指導下，排演出了感動人心的戲劇，甚至鼓舞了許多市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您過獎了，埃利西奧先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是盡力去效仿那些再也無法回到學校的老師……特別是我最敬重的一位女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是戈爾丁女士嗎？我聽海蒂小姐提起過她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我們正在彩排的這齣戲劇，就是她最後留在這間教室裡的作品——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個可愛的故事，講的是兩個孩子為了尋找一隻能帶走病痛的羽獸而踏上了冒險，最終成功拯救了生病的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士曾經問我，戈爾丁女士在寫這個故事時是否曾把它當作“毫無意義的自我安慰”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼會呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我可以留下來看看孩子們的彩排嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是為了孩子們，也為了向您和那位女士表達敬意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，在這裡，在倫蒂尼姆，我還有很多能幫得上忙的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……致戈爾丁女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……致戈爾丁女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g4_victoriaconferencehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有議員都到齊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到齊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距離全城廣播還有多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩分鐘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>那是接近新年的一個傍晚。</i>\n\\n<i>經歷數年驚心動魄的日子後，許多人終於能夠安心與家人圍坐在餐桌前，一邊享用晚餐，一邊收聽倫蒂尼姆議長的廣播——人們戲稱其為“晚餐宣言”。</i>\n\\n<i>可惜的是，那頓晚飯的滋味並不美好。</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"測試，測試，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以開始了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是維娜·維多利亞。我以倫蒂尼姆議會議長的名義，向所有反對戰爭且仍然生活在倫蒂尼姆的市民們發表公開演講。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g5_victoriaspeakeasy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩個月前，我們從一場災難中走了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都給我安靜！沒聽到議長閣下在講話嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我代表議會向所有在戰爭中付出貢獻的英雄致敬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一位市民、每一位聯軍士兵、每一位典範軍的戰士——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市會銘記你們每一個人的貢獻，也緬懷所有離我們而去的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒館內一片寂靜，每個人都舉起了酒杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟們，敬你們……也敬我自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g3_school_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今的倫蒂尼姆已進入漫長的重建期，秩序正在恢復，過去熟悉的生活也在回歸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但並非所有事物都能回到從前……議會決定，典範軍——這支曾在特殊時期誕生的光榮隊伍，將永久保留其番號，以紀念它的歷史與未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到孩子們在唱歌，那些退役的士兵們也跟著一起哼唱。他們看起來心情都不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們唱的，是這齣戲劇的結尾——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生病的孩子終於康復了，他們找到了屬於自己的幸福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……還以為那些無家可歸的士兵會更在意議長的演講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們當然在意，但他們更相信議長閣下絕不會拋下他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茉莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_657_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經歷過痛苦之後，幸福總會到來。埃利西奧先生，您相信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍的成員們都因“回家”這個最純粹的信念聚集在一起，不論身分、不論地位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今，典範軍的信念終於實現，我們回家了，也迎來了這段旅程的終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不屑的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“終點”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不屑的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來那位議長閣下最後還是決定解散那支隊伍，真是愚蠢……自己親手把心腹都遣散了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你覺得那支背景複雜的軍隊該怎麼處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續追擊那些薩卡茲？還是再去找那些公爵的麻煩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不屑的傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"典範軍的事，輪不到我們操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“銑痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在最重要的是快點恢復我們自己的實力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g4_ordnancefactory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"許多典範軍的成員已經加入了城防軍，繼續守護我們的家園。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而那些不願再拿起武器的人也有權選擇回歸平靜的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"議會在此承諾會妥善安置每一位典範軍的戰友。這或許需要時間，但議長辦公室的大門，永遠為我的同袍們敞開——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……維娜，這件事恐怕要花上好幾年，你還有很長的路要走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開心的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱瑟琳，來吃晚餐嗎？幾個剛退役的老朋友回來工廠報到啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開心的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們見到你一定會很開心的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不就是盯上了我辛苦存下來的菸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開心的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去的。對了，順便通知大家，多找些人來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_4162_cathy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等議會重新啟動更多工廠，人手肯定不夠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我，維娜·維多利亞，也向所有市民承諾，在這個沒有國王的未來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"廣播突兀地中斷，達格達聽見城內的喧囂聲忽然迴盪開來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廣播被切斷了？議會那邊……發生了什麼事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g4_victoriaconferencehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"議長閣下，戴菲恩閣下，我剛在維護廣播系統時突然發現了這個舊零件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這早該在阿利斯泰爾陛下在位時就換掉的東西……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道這麼不起眼的老東西還能運作啊！師父也從來沒跟我提過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以只是意外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的工程維修確認單上為什麼突然多了一項以前沒有的選項？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我只是照著系統同步給我的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我能旁聽一下議會的討論嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……馬奇伯爵閣下……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾莉諾——維娜，我的名字不難記吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看起來對我的到來很意外，難道沒有人提前通知你們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，看來你的眼線最近有點鬆懈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯爵閣下，倫蒂尼姆沒必要依靠什麼“眼線”來接待客人吧。這座城市歡迎每一位熱愛這片土地的維多利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你應該不會介意我邀請幾位公爵閣下重返故地，來場小小的聚會吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算算時間，他們應該已經到了。畢竟身分敏感，隨便去誰的府上做客都會讓人猶豫，所以我就自作主張借用你的地方一用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望議會能理解我們的難處。維娜，我們也誠摯邀請你參加。當然，還有你，戴菲恩小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你很快就要啟程回溫德米爾領了。有幾位老朋友希望你能順道帶去他們對你母親的悼念。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"艾莉諾微微一笑，脫下帽子向戴菲恩致意。\n隨即她走到維娜身旁，壓低了聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g4_victoriaconferencehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜歡你的演講，很明智的決定。但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太急躁了。有些話，你可以在我們面前說，卻不該直接對那些平民公開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為他們好，也是為你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以是你故意切斷我們的廣播？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，我們會在皇家科學院小聚。時間不會太久，別遲到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，有時候不需要覺得自己做得還不夠好。這座城市的變化已經超出我的想像了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>皇家科學院待客廳</><p=2>1098年12月22日 7:32 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下，我還以為您的胃口會更差一點呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小艾莉諾，我一向懂得面對現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆的局勢我們都心知肚明，這些淡酒和麵包已經足以展現議長閣下的誠意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威靈頓公爵依舊沒有露面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，看來你跟威靈頓公爵閣下的盟約似乎沒有想像中那麼牢固啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下，大家都清楚這只是場面話。老威靈頓是不可能出現在這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你覺得我們該怎麼應對威靈頓公爵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這跟倫蒂尼姆無關，跟我更沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的在乎你們怎麼想嗎？畢竟，他才是那個永遠掌握主導權的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據我所知，“加斯特里爾”號和它的護衛艦隊自從兩個月前城牆之戰後，引擎就從未熄火過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威靈頓一直在等著你們動手，恐怕，他現在對你們很失望吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩·溫德米爾，但你看到的終究只是表面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉與維多利亞在老威靈頓眼中的關係究竟如何，現在還遠遠不到下定論的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩個月來，我們之間一直維持著……某種默契。只要沒有人主動撕破這層面子，它就還能維持下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，開斯特公爵閣下的使者可是接二連三地秘密造訪威靈頓公爵領，這件事，恐怕她才是最有資格發言的人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會回去徹查到底是誰違抗了我的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，等你回到溫德米爾領後，我在麗茵卡登的酒莊隨時歡迎疲憊的客人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以省省這些無聊的客套話了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆歡迎每一位維多利亞人，但我們沒時間陪各位浪費時間。現在還有許多市民的問題急需解決，遠比在座的各位更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我很清楚，你們突然同時到訪倫蒂尼姆也不是沒原因的……呵，默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道威靈頓只是個藉口，這件事議會根本插不上手。所以如果接下來的話題與議會無關，那我也沒必要繼續待在這裡浪費時間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你錯了，維娜。現在威靈頓公爵的選擇確實與你有關。更準確地說，與過去的那位陛下——你的父親有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十六年前，老威靈頓從未在你父親的議案上表態。他只是沈默旁觀，看著阿利斯泰爾陛下從王座一步步走向絞刑架……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，他失望了——對維多利亞失望，對公爵們失望，對你的父親失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從那時起，塔拉的暗流就從未停息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……溫德米爾公爵從來沒跟我提起過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的母親根本不在乎，也沒有人會因為處死國王而後悔。抱歉，維娜，我不是有意冒犯，但你應該明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老威靈頓雖然不會親自來倫蒂尼姆，但不代表他不關注這裡，也不代表他不關注你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們暫時還無法確定他的真實態度。但王座空了這麼多年，並不代表維多利亞不想要一位國王。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"維娜不明白艾莉諾的意思——她早就表明立場了。\n國王、王冠，從來都不是她想要的東西——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*維多利亞粗口*，維娜，巡邏隊剛剛來你辦公室通報——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王座廳的王冠被偷了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開斯特公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞議長，看來我們的會議得暫緩了。有個小插曲恐怕需要你去處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小公爵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1518_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，如果你需要幫忙，你知道該去哪裡找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，看來我們又得多打擾你一陣子了，議長閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們*維多利亞粗口*。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
